 "name_en": "Key Risk Indicator Monitoring with SAP Risk Management (2U2)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Key Risk Indicator Monitoring with SAP Risk Management (2U2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6ff7c649271142548b765a8dad162d7f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6ff7c649271142548b765a8dad162d7f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">Customers can integrate SAP Risk Management on premise with <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to support a unified view of risk across the enterprise. This scope item enables communication between the applications so that SAP Risk Management can monitor risk indicators in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6ff7c649271142548b765a8dad162d7f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor continuously from <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> with pre-built indicators</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create control, performance, and risk indicators without programming</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get expanded monitoring content to support best practices</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">View documentation of monitoring rules designed for nontechnical users</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6ff7c649271142548b765a8dad162d7f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Get real-time insight into status of internal controls and risks in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> and reduced total cost of ownership</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and view key indicators and metrics by business users</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Deploy and maximize automation to minimize routine tasks</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用 SAP Risk Management 的关键风险指标监控 (2U2)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6ff7c649271142548b765a8dad162d7f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6ff7c649271142548b765a8dad162d7f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">客户可将 SAP Risk Management 企业预置与 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 集成，以支持整个企业的统一风险视图。此范围项目支持应用程序之间的通信，以便 SAP Risk Management 可以监控 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中的风险指标。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6ff7c649271142548b765a8dad162d7f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>，利用预构建的指标持续监控</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">无需编程即可创建控制、绩效和风险指标</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">获取扩展监控内容以支持最佳实践</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看为非技术用户设计的监控规则文档</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6ff7c649271142548b765a8dad162d7f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">实时了解 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中的内部控制与风险状态，降低总体拥有成本</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">按业务用户创建和查看关键指标和指标。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">部署和最大限度地提高自动化程度，最大限度地减少日常任务</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
